  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞美食广场……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伙伴们似乎正在休息……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 07 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D8 07}啊，说着说着，“搭档”就来了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}什么意思？{F5 47 02 01 02 01 09 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}请多关照，搭档！{F5 47 02 01 02 01 0D 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我们在说你的搭档呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C6 07}怎么成我了。\n我们刚好在说你的搭档！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 07 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 06}花村学长说把理世惹哭了，\n正消沉着呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 FC 04}我才没哭。\n我可没有一滴眼泪，\n是给花村那个笨蛋学长的！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}你、你也不用说到这份上……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 0F 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}因为他就是个笨蛋嘛！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}总是把自己放在最后，让人担心……\n一个人决定重要的事，\n好像哪天就会突然消失……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B9 05}……嗯，他是有那一面。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C0 03}别看花村那样，其实很有包容力呢。\n还让小熊住在自己家。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}当时还吓了一跳，\n居然真的接纳他了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 08 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……他是个好人呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 07 01 0F 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E4 04}我们可不想让他好到那个地步。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}所以才说他是笨蛋啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}笨得让人头疼。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 0B}呵呵……这样啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:17:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞回过神来，阳介已经站在身后……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 04 01 05 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D0 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}你、你们啊！！\n“笨蛋”也说得太多了吧！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}啊，被听见了。\n有什么关系，我们在夸你呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 11 01 07 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2A 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}哪里是夸啊！？\n一个个都在说笨蛋……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}原来你从那里才开始听啊……\n真、真遗憾……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}就是笨蛋。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}确实是笨蛋呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 33 0B}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}啊，啊哈哈……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_220.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞眼含泪光的阳介，还是先别管他吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
